---
import BlueGradientCard from "../layouts/BlueGradientCard.astro";
---

<BlueGradientCard class="max-w-fit">
  <h2 class="mb-4 text-base font-light">Why?</h2>
  <p class="textBalance mb-2 text-xs font-hand">
    After over a decade of building frontends, scaling systems, and
    collaborating across product, design, and engineering, one pattern keeps
    repeating:
  </p>
  <p class="textBalance mb-6 text-xs font-mono">
    Documentation helps you ship.<br />
    And books help you decide what to build — and why.
  </p>
  <p class="textBalance mb-0 text-xs font-hand">
    This collection reflects how I think about software today:
  </p>
  <ul class="mb-6 list-disc pl-5 text-xs font-hand">
    <li>Trade-offs over tools</li>
    <li>Systems over features</li>
    <li>People over abstractions</li>
  </ul>
  <p class="textBalance mb-4 text-xs font-hand">
    Read these in any order.<br />
    The connections will reveal themselves over time.
  </p>
  <p class="text-xs font-hand">
    <strong>Stay curious,</strong><br />Sid
  </p>
</BlueGradientCard>
<style>
  @reference "../styles/global.css";
  strong {
    @apply text-(--highlightText);
  }
  @media screen and (max-width: 450px) {
    ul {
      @apply pl-4;
    }
  }
</style>
